      "roots": [
        "Agent105UniformReturn"
      ],
      "scope": "Actual Agent8 list dynamics: eventual positive safe-return existence on a fixed finite signed-affine run family of symbols at most 18, with positive width slope and positive parameter shift and eventual original CanonicalPair, implies one common positive safe-return time at most 4*widthSlope*s on an entire parameter tail. Actual affine closure, equality/safety stability, eventual head/width and the finite time bound are proved. The registry does not assert return existence for a particular integer or ordinary-integer realization of every CanonicalPair."
    }
